---
const steps = [
  ["對齊症狀與範圍", "請求、時間、宿主機或容器"],
  ["CPU 與工作狀態", "load、r／b、CPU 使用與閒置"],
  ["記憶體與限制", "available、si／so、群組額度"],
  ["儲存容量與等待", "區塊、inode、await、IO PSI"],
  ["一次處置一項", "比較延遲、錯誤與完成量"],
];
---

<figure
  class="linux-diagnosis-diagram"
  aria-labelledby="linux-diagnosis-caption"
>
  <svg
    class="linux-diagnosis-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 320 560"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="linux-diagnosis-title linux-diagnosis-desc"
  >
    <title id="linux-diagnosis-title">主機變慢的觀察順序</title>
    <desc id="linux-diagnosis-desc"
      >先確認症狀與範圍，再分開看 CPU、記憶體和儲存，最後以服務指標驗證處置。</desc
    >
    {
      steps.map(([title, detail], i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x="8" y={8 + i * 112} width="304" height="96" rx="12" />
          <text class="linux-diagnosis-diagram__title" x="24" y={43 + i * 112}>
            {title}
          </text>
          <text class="linux-diagnosis-diagram__detail" x="24" y={75 + i * 112}>
            {detail}
          </text>
          {i < 4 && <path d={`M160 ${104 + i * 112} V${120 + i * 112}`} />}
        </g>
      ))
    }
  </svg>
  <div class="linux-diagnosis-diagram__mobile">
    {
      steps.map(([title, detail]) => (
        <section>
          <>
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <p>{detail}</p>
          </>
        </section>
      ))
    }
  </div>
  <figcaption id="linux-diagnosis-caption">
    各項觀察對齊同一時段；這是縮小問題的路線，不是固定根因或通用警報門檻。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .linux-diagnosis-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 26rem;
    height: auto;
    margin: auto;
  }
  rect {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .linux-diagnosis-diagram__title {
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
    font: 700 18px var(--font-body);
  }
  .linux-diagnosis-diagram__detail {
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font: 14px var(--font-body);
  }
  path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .linux-diagnosis-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }
  .linux-diagnosis-diagram__mobile section {
    padding: 1rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--dg-surface);
  }
  .linux-diagnosis-diagram__mobile h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--dg-ink);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .linux-diagnosis-diagram__mobile p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .linux-diagnosis-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .linux-diagnosis-diagram__mobile {
      display: block;
    }
  }
</style>
